  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Loading Data&gt;&gt;&gt;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">✦Lily✦</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">A young perfumer swept up in the Federated Cities' Resonator War, whose rare Resonance Ability made her a psychotherapist to the soldiers around her.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">She could not stop the war. What a gentle girl could do was save whoever stood in front of her, with everything she had.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\"><br><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793980800000/ewhqz8yx3iwnb48es1-1794017197518.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1422\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793980800000/iexkaqp5y27ff2v3g1-1794017212963.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1556\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793980800000/j0vdincuavjd9r8hre-1794017295715.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793980800000/6sn16dv6mh0iue12id-1794017319797.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793980800000/2bhcfxpe06ykr4e1s5-1794017336070.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"938\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\">